CodeSystem: Form111_PatientBadHabitCS
Id: form111-patient-bad-habit-cs
Title: "Form 111 Patient Bad Habit Code"
Description: "Form 111 Patient Bad Habit Code for clinical documents and other knowledge resources in Uzbekistan integrations. Based on Ministry of Health Order 399."
* insert OriginalCodeSystemDraft(form111-patient-bad-habit-cs)  

